# Data Model

## Rider

Stores one rider profile.

Fields

- Name
- Current Bike
- Handlebar X
- Handlebar Y
- Frame Stack
- Frame Reach
- Stem
- Spacers
- Saddle Height
- Saddle Setback
- Preferences

---

## Bike

One record per bike size.

Example

Specialized Tarmac SL8 54

Specialized Tarmac SL8 56

are separate records.

---

## Fit Result

Generated dynamically.

Contains

- Bike
- Size
- Predicted Handlebar X
- Predicted Handlebar Y
- Stem Recommendation
- Spacer Recommendation
- Fit Confidence

Never stored permanently.
